("Which drones must be registered with Transport Canada before they fly?",
 "250 g and heavier", ["Over 25 kg only", "500 g and heavier", "Over 1 kg only"],
 "CAR 900.13 requires every remotely piloted aircraft with an operating weight of 250 g or more to be registered. A drone under 250 g is a micro-RPA and needs no registration."),
